<view class="page"><image class="bg" src="/images/runtime/team-data-emerald-stadium-v1.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="content"><view class="nav"><text class="back" bindtap="back">‹</text><text class="nav-title">球队资料</text></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在读取球队资料…</view><block wx:else><view class="hero"><image wx:if="{{profile.logo}}" src="{{profile.logo}}" mode="aspectFit" class="crest"/><text wx:else class="crest placeholder">球队</text><view><text class="name">{{profile.name}}</text><text class="claimed">{{profile.claimText}}</text><text class="complete">资料完整度 {{completenessText}}</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{editing}}" class="card"><text class="card-title">编辑基础资料</text><input value="{{form.name}}" data-key="name" bindinput="input" placeholder="球队名称"/><input value="{{form.shortName}}" data-key="shortName" bindinput="input" placeholder="球队简称"/><input value="{{form.ageGroup}}" data-key="ageGroup" bindinput="input" placeholder="年龄组"/><input value="{{form.foundedYear}}" data-key="foundedYear" bindinput="input" placeholder="成立年份"/><input value="{{form.city}}" data-key="city" bindinput="input" placeholder="所在城市"/><input value="{{form.managerName}}" data-key="managerName" bindinput="input" placeholder="负责人"/><button bindtap="save" loading="{{saving}}" class="primary">保存长期球队资料</button><button bindtap="cancel" class="secondary">取消</button></view><block wx:else><view class="card"><text class="card-title">基础资料</text><view class="row"><text>球队名称</text><text>{{profile.name}}</text></view><view class="row"><text>球队简称</text><text>{{profile.shortName}}</text></view><view class="row"><text>年龄组</text><text>{{profile.ageGroup}}</text></view><view class="row"><text>成立年份</text><text>{{profile.foundedYear}}</text></view><view class="row"><text>所在城市</text><text>{{profile.city}}</text></view></view><view class="card"><text class="card-title">联系资料</text><view class="row"><text>负责人</text><text>{{profile.managerName}}</text></view><view class="row"><text>联系电话</text><text>{{profile.managerPhoneMasked}}</text></view><view class="row"><text>所属机构</text><text>{{profile.orgName}}</text></view></view><view class="card"><view class="venue-head"><text class="card-title">主场设置</text><text wx:if="{{canManage}}" class="venue-add" bindtap="openAddVenue">+ 添加</text></view><view wx:if="{{hasHomeVenues}}" class="venue-list"><view class="venue-card" wx:for="{{homeVenues}}" wx:key="id"><view class="venue-card-head"><view class="venue-name-row"><text class="venue-name">{{item.name}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.isDefault}}" class="venue-badge">默认</text></view><text wx:if="{{item.address}}" class="venue-addr">{{item.address}}</text></view><view class="venue-btns"><text class="venue-btn" catchtap="openVenueMap" data-index="{{index}}" wx:if="{{item.hasLocation}}">导航</text><text class="venue-btn" catchtap="editVenue" data-index="{{index}}" wx:if="{{canManage}}">编辑</text><text class="venue-btn" catchtap="setDefaultVenue" data-index="{{index}}" wx:if="{{canManage}}">设默认</text><text class="venue-btn danger" catchtap="deleteVenue" data-index="{{index}}" wx:if="{{canManage}}">删除</text></view></view></view><view wx:else class="venue-empty" bindtap="openAddVenue"><text class="venue-empty-text">还没保存主场，点这里添加</text></view><text class="venue-tip">设默认后，发起邀约与发起比赛会自动带上场地和定位。</text></view><view class="venue-editor-mask" wx:if="{{venueEditorVisible}}" bindtap="closeVenueEditor"><view class="venue-editor" catchtap=""><text class="venue-editor-title">{{venueEditorTitle}}</text><view class="venue-editor-row"><text class="venue-editor-label">场地名称</text><input class="venue-editor-input" placeholder="如：开封立洋小学足球场" placeholder-class="venue-editor-ph" value="{{editorVenueName}}" bindinput="onEditorNameInput" maxlength="30" /></view><view class="venue-editor-row"><text class="venue-editor-label">定位</text><view class="venue-editor-loc-row"><view class="venue-editor-map-btn" bindtap="onPickEditorLocation"><text>📍 地图选点</text></view><view wx:if="{{editorVenueHasLoc}}" class="venue-editor-loc-info"><text class="venue-editor-loc-addr">{{editorVenueAddress}}</text><text class="venue-editor-loc-clear" bindtap="clearEditorLocation">清除</text></view><text wx:else class="venue-editor-loc-hint">地图页顶部可直接搜场地名，选好后自动带回地址</text></view></view><view class="venue-editor-btns"><button class="venue-editor-btn cancel" bindtap="closeVenueEditor">取消</button><button class="venue-editor-btn save" bindtap="saveVenue">保存</button></view></view></view><view class="note">长期球队资料的修改不会覆盖已审核名单和已完成比赛快照。</view><button wx:if="{{canManage}}" bindtap="edit" class="primary">编辑球队资料</button><view wx:if="{{isOwner}}" class="transfer-team"><button bindtap="transferTeamOwner" loading="{{transferBusy}}" disabled="{{transferBusy}}">移交主账号给新负责人</button><text class="transfer-tip">移交后你不再管理这支球队；对方无需确认，用该手机号登录小程序即可看到球队。</text></view><view wx:if="{{isOwner}}" class="delete-team"><button bindtap="deleteEmptyTeam" loading="{{deleteBusy}}" disabled="{{!canDeleteTeam}}">删除空球队</button><text class="delete-reason" wx:if="{{deleteReason}}">{{deleteReason}}</text></view></block></block></view></view>
